{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111824","id":2928026361,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6uhiL5","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111824","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111824.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111824.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111824","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111824/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111824/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111824/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e79a3fbb32c79c687ad4e4caaaa9f2c80800ad59","number":111824,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"TileSet: Add option to pack multiple tile images into single atlas","user":{"login":"CodyKlimkofski","id":50000309,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDAwMzA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50000309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski","html_url":"https://github.com/CodyKlimkofski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodyKlimkofski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Origin\r\nI was using Kenney.nl's race texture pack but was a bit annoyed with the prospect of having to create my own unified atlas .png to properly use the TileSet. Instead, I've adjusted the code to allow for the importing of multiple image files, and an atlas is automatically created from there.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n- Added new menu option \"Atlas from Multiple Images\" in the TileSet sources add menu\r\n- Implemented grid-based packing that ensured proper image alignment with Godot's grid-only coordinate system\r\n- Uses first image dimensions as the grid cell size (works for my purpose but probably needs adjusting for images of multiple sizes before going to main)\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\nTested manually by importing multiple tile images of the same size and verifying proper atlas functionality. \r\n\r\nThanks all!","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga